ishu-049-zhangchong:p006:m0098","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-zhangchong-ws2261984","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006","quote":"明年二月，梁王出沔口，圍魯山城。遣軍主曹景宗等過江攻郢城，未及盡濟，沖遣中兵參軍陳光靜等開門出擊，爲義師所破，光靜戰死，沖固守不出。景宗於是據石橋浦，連軍相續，下至加湖。東昏遣軍主巴西梓潼二郡太守吳子陽、光子衿、李文釗、陳虎牙等十三軍援郢，至加湖不得進，乃築城舉烽，城內亦舉火應之。而內外各自保，不能相救。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006:m0098"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"th-nanqishu-049-zhangchong-6-90","title":"巴西梓潼二郡太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","person_id":"fcd_60a_77e","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanqishu-049-zhangchong-6-90:a","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006","start":90,"end":98,"surface":"巴西梓潼二郡太守","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006:m0098","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-049","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong","source_id":"s-nanqishu-049-zhangchong-ws2261984","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006","quote":"明年二月，梁王出沔口，圍魯山城。遣軍主曹景宗等過江攻郢城，未及盡濟，沖遣中兵參軍陳光靜等開門出擊，爲義師所破，光靜戰死，沖固守不出。景宗於是據石橋浦，連軍相續，下至加湖。東昏遣軍主巴西梓潼二郡太守吳子陽、光子衿、李文釗、陳虎牙等十三軍援郢，至加湖不得進，乃築城舉烽，城內亦舉火應之。而內外各自保，不能相救。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-049-zhangchong:p006:m0098"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"